<title>USA: BioWhittaker exploring strategic options.</title>
<headline>BioWhittaker exploring strategic options.</headline>
<dateline>WALKERSVILLE, Md. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BioWhittaker Inc said Wednesday that it has retained Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc to help it explore strategic alternatives &quot;including possible acquisitions and/or strategic business combinations.&quot;</p>
<p>The company, which supplies products to the biotechnology, biopharmaceutical and life science research industries, said its business is now focused in bioprocessing and life science research markets.</p>
